§§ `Paragraph (f): old assets (forks V1, V2)`
-- Unpaid-for goodwill (so (b), not (b1)) acquired in 1940, sold 30 June 2013, real gain 900,000, capital gain 1,000,000, flat scale: the ordinary tax
-- is 900,000 x 25% = 225,000. The (f) rate is 12% plus 1% per tax year from 2005: counting 2005 and 2013 both, 9 years: 21%; not counting 2005, 8 years: 20%.
--   21%: the lesser of 225,000 and 21% x 1,000,000 = 210,000 ; 20%: the lesser of 225,000 and 200,000 = 200,000.
